            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_eKBrrR": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Dehydrated_Lemons.svg",
            "title": "Dehydrated Lemons",
            "text": "<p>A crystallized lemon flavouring that is made from real lemon juice and oils.<\/p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_8yHAnC": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/baking_soda.svg",
            "title": "Baking Soda",
            "text": "<p>A critical electrolyte found in the plasma of our blood is the <br\/>combination of sodium cations (+) and bicarbonate anions (-), playing a crucial role in maintaining the body's pH balance and supporting variousphysiological functions.<\/p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_NxTGaK": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Potassium.svg",
            "title": "Potassium",
            "text": "<p>Potassium is the predominant electrolyte found within your cells. It is among the more challenging electrolytes to obtain through our typical diet.<\/p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_UUKGUF": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Salt.svg",
            "title": "Salts",
            "text": "<p>Sodium and Chloride are the most common electrolytes in your blood and needs constant replenishment. When you consume salt, it can help <br\/>increase your thirst and encourage you to drink more water, leading to <br\/>better hydration.<\/p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_8gqBKK": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Citric_Acid.svg",
            "title": "Citric Acid",
            "text": "<p>Citric acid is used for flavor enhancement, antioxidant protection, and as a source of citrate for energy production. Its versatile properties improve taste, effectiveness, and stability of the product.<\/p>",
